{
  "_comment": [
    "Terrible-address rate = share of addrman entries with now - nTime > 30 days",
    "(ADDRMAN_HORIZON, the first arm of AddrInfo::IsTerrible). getrawaddrman does",
    "not expose nAttempts / m_last_try / m_last_success, so the other three arms of",
    "IsTerrible() cannot be evaluated -- every figure here is a LOWER BOUND.",
    "",
    "'manual' readings are point-in-time getrawaddrman captures taken by hand.",
    "'cron' readings come from ~/addrman-snaps/ on each node (hourly since",
    "2026-07-24 09:03 UTC) and carry total/terrible counts, not just the rate.",
    "",
    "OUTAGES MATTER: while a node is down, wall-clock keeps advancing but no gossip",
    "arrives to refresh anything, so the rate rises purely from ageing. Any segment",
    "spanning an outage is not a behavioural trend and is drawn dashed."
  ],
  "outages": {
    "test":    [["2026-07-20T12:00:00Z", "2026-07-24T08:52:00Z"]],
    "control": [["2026-06-08T11:00:00Z", "2026-06-09T09:00:00Z"],
                ["2026-07-22T20:00:00Z", "2026-07-24T07:00:00Z"]]
